  "method": [
    "Hash complete archive bytes with SHA-256. Open ZIP read-only, hash uncompressed librocksdbjni-win64.dll and org/rocksdb/RocksDB.class streams.",
    "Build name-to-SHA-256 maps of every org/rocksdb/*.class ZIP entry, rejecting duplicate names; compare exact member sets and hashes.",
    "Read the two hash-pinned DLLs as data. Parse PE32+ section headers, hash each SizeOfRawData byte range from PointerToRawData; resolve export names through the export directory. Export digest hashes UTF-8 sorted names joined by LF with a final LF.",
    "Read version export bytes at recorded raw offset. B8 03 01 0A 00 C3 encodes mov eax,0x000A0103; ret. Record NUL-terminated ASCII build strings with their raw offsets.",
    "Compare every DLL byte, recording every maximal contiguous differing run; old/current are hexadecimal bytes for published 10.1.3/10.2.1 respectively.",
    "Resolve upstream tag objects using GitHub Git reference/tag APIs. Embedded source markers and publication identity do not establish a clean, reproducible build."
  ],
